      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "T\xE1 t\xFAs curtha le do thuras m\xF3r. Caithfidh t\xFA an cloch dra\xEDochta
    a aimsi\xFA sa Choill Mhe\xE1naoiseach. B\xED c\xFAramach, t\xE1 an doicheallach
    ag f\xE1na\xEDocht sna sc\xE1thanna. T\xE1 s\xE9 r\xE1ite go mbeidh t\xFA in
    ann do chinni\xFAint a athr\xFA m\xE1 aims\xEDonn t\xFA an cloch roimh \xE9ir\xED
    na gr\xE9ine. N\xED bheidh s\xE9 \xE9asca, t\xE1 an dra\xEDocht ag cosaint an
    chos\xE1in. Nuair a bheidh an chloch agat, caithfidh t\xFA \xED a thabhairt ar
    ais go dt\xED an Teampall Caillte. \r\nD\xE9an cinnte gan dul am\xFA sa phirimid,
    mar t\xE1 na haint\xEDonna ag m\xFAscailt. M\xE1 theipeann ort, rachaidh an t-am
    as, agus beidh an dorchadas i r\xE9im go deo."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 702154658dacc004eb5d71f4b0e40ce3, type: 2}
